# Normalise to LF in the repository.
#
# This matters beyond tidiness: the Dockerfile, Caddyfile and shell-invoked
# scripts are read on Linux, and a CRLF line ending there produces errors that
# look nothing like a line-ending problem. Committing LF keeps a Windows
# checkout building the same images as a Linux one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets should never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Lockfiles are generated; collapse them in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
